ccc + (e[R+1] - e[L]) * (i+1+jj) \\\r\n\t\t\t\t\t+ (f[R+1] - f[L])) % mod\r\n\t\t\tbbb = (bbb + ccc * z[jj]) % mod\r\n\t\t#print(bbb)\r\n\t\taaa += (bbb * A(n,n-i)) % mod\r\n\t\t#print(nz)\r\n\t\tz = nz\r\n\t#print(z)\r\n\tprint(aaa % mod)\r\n\r\nsolve()\r\n\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static long MOD = 0;\n\n    static long factorial(long n) {\n        long res = 1;\n        for (long i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n            res = (res * i) % MOD;\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n\n    static long A(long n, long k) {\n        long res = 1;\n        for (long i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            res = (res * (n - i)) % MOD;\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n\n    public static void solve() {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n        MOD = sc.nextLong();\n        \n        if (n == 1) {\n            System.out.println(0);\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        List<Long> z = new ArrayList<>();\n        z.add(1L);\n        \n        long aaa = 0;\n        \n        for (long i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n            List<Long> nz = new ArrayList<>();\n            int nzSize = (int)(i * i / 2);\n            for (int j = 0; j < nzSize; j++) {\n                nz.add(0L);\n            }\n            \n            for (int j = 0; j < z.size(); j++) {\n                long zj = z.get(j);\n                for (int k = 0; k < i; k++) {\n                    if (zj > 0) {\n                        int idx = (int)(i - k - 1 + j);\n                        if (idx < nz.size()) {\n                            long val = nz.get(idx);\n                            nz.set(idx, (val + zj) % MOD);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            \n            long bbb = 0;\n            \n            List<Long> d = new ArrayList<>();\n            for (int j = 0; j < z.size() + 1; j++) {\n                d.add(0L);\n            }\n            \n            for (int w = z.size() - 1; w >= 0; w--) {\n                long val = (d.get(w + 1) + z.get(w)) % MOD;\n                d.set(w, val);\n            }\n            \n            List<Long> e = new ArrayList<>();\n            List<Long> f = new ArrayList<>();\n            for (int j = 0; j < z.size() + 2; j++) {\n                e.add(0L);\n                f.add(0L);\n            }\n            \n            for (int w = 0; w < z.size() + 1; w++) {\n                long valE = (e.get(w) + d.get(w)) % MOD;\n                long valF = (f.get(w) - w * d.get(w)) % MOD;\n                e.set(w + 1, valE);\n                f.set(w + 1, valF);\n            }\n            \n            for (int jj = 0; jj < z.size(); jj++) {\n                long ccc = 0;\n                int L = jj + 2;\n                int R = Math.min(z.size() - 1, (int)(i + jj));\n                \n                if (R >= L) {\n                    long term1 = (e.get(R + 1) - e.get(L)) % MOD;\n                    long term2 = (f.get(R + 1) - f.get(L)) % MOD;\n                    ccc = (ccc + term1 * (i + 1 + jj) % MOD + term2) % MOD;\n                }\n                bbb = (bbb + ccc * z.get(jj)) % MOD;\n            }\n            \n            aaa = (aaa + bbb * A(n, n - i)) % MOD;\n            z = nz;\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println((aaa % MOD + MOD) % MOD);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        solve();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.85\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-6.949660019017756e-05, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.729855441430118e-05, -2.276871418871451e-05, -0.6933930516242981, -0.14325445890426636, -4.7444173105759546e-05, -1.811964830267243e-05, -0.001311514643020928, -0.007674850057810545, -0.00010072677832795307, -2.622600959512056e-06,